{{!
    Main entry template for the Activity Statistics dashboard.
    Establishes the top-level layout and the primary visual hierarchy starting with an H2.
}}
<div class="tool_activitystatistics-container">
    <h2>{{#str}} index:overview:heading, tool_activitystatistics {{/str}}</h2>

    {{!
        This renders the top-level KPI (Key Performance Indicator) tiles for the dashboard.
        The necessary data variables (total_activities, total_count, last_update) are expected
        to be directly available in the root context passed by the backend.
    }}
    {{> tool_activitystatistics/overview_cards }}

    {{!
        Static visualization block. Unlike the historical data, this single bar chart
        does not require complex filter forms, so it is kept inline rather than
        being abstracted into its own partial. The H3 maintains the descending typography scale.
    }}
    <div class="row mt-4">
        <div class="col-12">
            <h3>{{#str}} index:activity_distribution:heading, tool_activitystatistics {{/str}}</h3>
            {{{ bar_chart }}}
        </div>
    </div>

    {{!
        Delegates the rendering of the complex time-filtered charts to a dedicated partial.
        This keeps the main index template concise and maintainable.
    }}
    {{> tool_activitystatistics/historical_data }}

</div>